{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CvuwLMUjn5WEWRNm8ZSx5o","type":"tool_result","content":"# AAAI Review Scoring Scale\n\nBased on the provided web page content, **specific scoring scale definitions are not included**. The page displays AAAI 2026 statistics and mentions that reviewer scores exist (with references to \"rating\" and \"confidence\" metrics), but it does not document what individual scores from 1-10 represent or provide labeled definitions for acceptance decisions.\n\nThe page references data fields like \"[Collected] Rating\" and \"[OpenReview] Rating\" but provides no breakdown of score meanings or review dimension definitions. To find AAAI's official scoring rubric, you would need to consult the conference's author guidelines or reviewer instructions directly, which are not included in this statistics portal."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e048c7cb-c26e-4a6a-9302-1c61fd6549ca","uuid":"72ebb4fb-6033-403f-8cf5-d9fdf6b790da","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:45:14.071Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":221970,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# AAAI Review Scoring Scale\n\nBased on the provided web page content, **specific scoring scale definitions are not included**. The page displays AAAI 2026 statistics and mentions that reviewer scores exist (with references to \"rating\" and \"confidence\" metrics), but it does not document what individual scores from 1-10 represent or provide labeled definitions for acceptance decisions.\n\nThe page references data fields like \"[Collected] Rating\" and \"[OpenReview] Rating\" but provides no breakdown of score meanings or review dimension definitions. To find AAAI's official scoring rubric, you would need to consult the conference's author guidelines or reviewer instructions directly, which are not included in this statistics portal.","durationMs":6612,"url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/aaai-statistics/aaai-2026-statistics/"}}
